### Fuzzy Machine
Tool: Gemini 3.6 Flash
Date: 25/7/2026
Prompt: Fix the logical bug in fuzzy_search function (priorites leastest error and highest frequency)
Output: A Solution code for logical ranking leatest error and highest frequency.
What I Modified:
    Before:
        #Only get top k results
        return candidates[:top_k]
    After: 
        #Priorites leastest error and highest frequency
        candidates.sort(key=lambda item: (item['errors'], -item['frequency']))
        return [item['word'] for item in candidates[:top_k]]
